JwtUtil.java
Utility class for JWT verification:

java
Copy
import io.jsonwebtoken.Claims;
import io.jsonwebtoken.Jwts;
import io.jsonwebtoken.security.Keys;
import javax.crypto.SecretKey;
import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;

public class JwtUtil {

    public static String extractUserIdentity(String token, String secret) {
        SecretKey key = Keys.hmacShaKeyFor(secret.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        Claims claims = Jwts.parserBuilder()
                .setSigningKey(key)
                .build()
                .parseClaimsJws(token)
                .getBody();
        return claims.getSubject(); // Assuming the user identity is stored in the subject
    }
}
GitLabService.java
Service class to interact with the GitLab API:

